# libv2ray.aar (Xray-core, LGPL-3.0, built via scripts/build_xray_aar.sh) IS
# committed on purpose — rebuilding it needs a full Go+NDK+gomobile toolchain,
# and without it the app falls back to StubTunnelEngine and can't actually
# connect. Re-run the build script and let it overwrite app/libs/libv2ray.aar
# when Xray-core needs an update.
